   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "In the short to medium term, given the macro-economic challenges, we anticipate some cautiousness from clients, however our data-backed insights and solutions continue to demonstrate value to our diversified client base.",
   "file": "20230613_MIND_Full-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-12-01",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "The Company is trading in line with the Board's recently revised expectations for the full year.  We started H2 FY24 with higher forward bookings than at the same point in the prior year.",
   "file": "20231201_MIND_Half-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-04-22",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
